0 Gimbal Lab — three motor axes and an orientation singularity
0 Name: gimbal-lab.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see LICENSE.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Original placements and programs. Standard LDraw geometry is external.
0 // One hub, three motors; explicit A/B/C ports; no invisible supports.
0 // A yaw, B pitch, C roll. Motors drive real native hinges.
0 // Respect the documented bounded cable travel and inspect cable slack.
0 // Simulation checks do not establish a physical hardware build.
